      "text": "3296165"
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "type": "SurroundingArea",
      "text": "With a stay at Pestana Chelsea Bridge Hotel \u0026 SPA in London (London City Centre), you\u0027ll be a 4-minute walk from Thames River and 8 minutes by foot from Battersea Power Station.  This spa hotel is 1.7 mi (2.7 km) from Buckingham Palace and 2.2 mi (3.5 km) from Natural History Museum."
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "type": "RoomTypes",
      "text": "Make yourself at home in one of the 217 individually decorated guestrooms, featuring refrigerators and LCD televisions. Wired and wireless internet access is complimentary, while iPod docking stations and digital programming provide entertainment. Private bathrooms with separate bathtubs and showers feature complimentary toiletries and hair dryers. Conveniences include phones, as well as safes and desks."
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "type": "PropertyInformation",
      "text": "Take time to pamper yourself with a visit to the full-service spa. If you\u0027re looking for recreational opportunities, you\u0027ll find an indoor pool and a fitness center. This hotel also features complimentary wireless internet access, concierge services, and wedding services."
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "type": "AreaActivities",
      "text": "Distances are displayed to the nearest 0.1 mile and kilometer. \u003Cbr /\u003E \u003Cp\u003EThames River - 0.3 km / 0.2 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Battersea Power Station - 0.7 km / 0.4 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Sloane Square - 1.6 km / 1 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Victoria Station Travel Information Centre - 1.8 km / 1.1 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Harrods - 2.4 km / 1.5 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E St. James Park - 2.6 km / 1.6 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Clapham Common - 2.6 km / 1.6 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Buckingham Palace - 2.6 km / 1.6 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Hyde Park - 2.8 km / 1.7 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Hyde Park Corner - 2.8 km / 1.7 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Cromwell Road - 2.8 km / 1.8 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Victoria and Albert Museum - 2.9 km / 1.8 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Green Park - 2.9 km / 1.8 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E The Oval - 2.9 km / 1.8 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Imperial College London - 2.9 km / 1.8 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E \u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003EThe nearest airports are:\u003Cbr /\u003ELondon City Airport (LCY) - 19.7 km / 12.2 mi\u003Cbr /\u003E Heathrow Airport (LHR) - 26 km / 16.2 mi\u003Cbr /\u003E Gatwick Airport (LGW) - 63.2 km / 39.3 mi\u003Cbr /\u003E Luton Airport (LTN) - 63.5 km / 39.4 mi\u003Cbr /\u003E Stansted Airport (STN) - 68.1 km / 42.3 mi\u003Cbr /\u003E \u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003C/p\u003E"
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "type": "PoliciesDisclaimers",
      "text": "\u003Cul\u003E  \u003Cli\u003EExtra-person charges may apply and vary depending on property policy\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGovernment-issued photo identification and a credit card may be required at check-in for incidental charges\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESpecial requests are subject to availability upon check-in and may incur additional charges; special requests cannot be guaranteed\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESpecial cancellation policies or charges may apply for group reservations (more than 8 rooms for the same property / stay dates)\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThis property accepts credit cards and cash\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThis property reserves the right to pre-authorize the guest\u0027s credit card prior to arrival.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESafety features at this property include a fire extinguisher and a first aid kit\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThis property is professionally cleaned\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPlease note that cultural norms and guest policies may differ by country and by property; the policies listed are provided by the property\u003C/li\u003E  \u003C/ul\u003E \u003Cul\u003E  \u003Cli\u003EThis property requires full payment at check-in for any bookings where payment for the stay will be made on site instead of at the time of booking. Incidentals or additional fees are due at check-out.\u003C/li\u003E  \u003C/ul\u003E \u003Cul\u003E  \u003Cli\u003EPool access available from 10:00 AM to 8:00 PM.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUp to 2 children 12 years old and younger stay free when occupying the parent or guardian\u0027s room, using existing bedding. \u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThe property has connecting/adjoining rooms, which are subject to availability and can be requested by contacting the property using the number on the booking confirmation. \u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThe property is professionally cleaned.\u003C/li\u003E \u003C/ul\u003E"
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "type": "DiningFacilities",
      "text": "Take advantage of the hotel\u0027s room service (during limited hours). English breakfasts are available daily from 7:00 AM to 11 AM for a fee."
    }
